   abstract = {The possibility of injury from X-rays is only one of the risks of working in a cardiac catheterization laboratory. This article introduces information that should help understand the physics and radiobiology associated with radiation protection. Cathet. Cardio-vasc. Intervent. 47:229-236, 1999.},
