   abstract = {This chapter introduces the reader to the position sensitive detection and imaging mechanisms and common types of position sensitive and imaging detectors. The concepts of spatial resolution, crosstalk, aliasing, and different spread functions have been discussed. Conventional imaging systems including x-ray photographic plates have been introduced. Details of modern imaging systems including CCD cameras have also been provided.},
   author = {Syed Naeem Ahmed},
